Ecommerce UI

Our Ecommerce UI is responsible for providing the user interface of our e-commerce application.

It allows customers to interact with the website and perform operations such as:

- View available products.
- View product details and prices.
- Check product availability.
- Register and log in.
- Add products to their cart.
- Place orders.
- View order information.
- Contact customer support.

The ecommerce UI displays this information but does not store the product informatino itself

Instead, it communicates with the backend microservices to retrieve the required information.

Important: Our ecommerce UI contains two main parts

1.React frontend: Displays the website and allows customers to interact with  it

2.Node.js / Express gateway: Receives the  api request from the frontend and forwards them to the appropriate backend microservice

